<section class="wrap section section--flush" id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p>
      <h2 id="problem-title">Notifications are rising, and the published record is hard to read as a whole</h2>
      <ul class="quotes quotes--solo"><li><figure><blockquote><p>The model never writes a digit.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="cite"><strong>Bluebird NDB Insights</strong>Ask</figcaption></figure></li></ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="copy">
        <p>Breach notifications have risen in each published half-year since January to June 2023. They reached 670 in July to December 2025, the highest in the series and 12.6% up on the same half of 2024. Privacy, risk and compliance teams need to understand the trends and meet their reporting obligations.</p>
        <p>The published record is hard to read as a whole. Figures are restated as notifications are assessed, reporting moved from quarterly to half-yearly and then to a dashboard, and one recent period was never published.</p>
      </div>
