        <h2 id="what-title">The whole published record, in one place</h2>
        <p>NDB Insights brings the scheme's published statistics together: notifications by month and the historical series since 2018, breach detail, and the time taken to identify, respond and notify.</p>
        <p>Each figure carries a basis label and a "Where did this come from?" link. A workspace adds three AI-assisted tools.</p>
      </div>
